  "description": "Teammachine SLR 01 is peak BMC: the ultimate carbon climbing frameset with minimal weight, next-level power transfer, advanced aerodynamics, and a ride feel shaped in our Impec Lab to be lighter, sharper, and faster than ever.\nThis ultra-light 01 Premium Carbon frame brings ruthless power transfer uphill with an uncompromisingly low weight and the sharpest handling on the way down.\nEvolved aerodynamics across the frame unlock free speed – bringing our most advanced lightweight road bike closer than ever to the Teammachine R 01 in outright aerodynamic performance.\nThis frame-only version with a stripped-back VAR0 finish is for those who want something different. It comes in raw carbon with easy-to-remove decals, becoming your canvas to create the BMC Teammachine SLR 01 of your dreams with a custom paint job and custom build.",
